<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria sells 55% in paint plant for $9.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria sells 55% in paint plant for $9.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's cabinet on Tuesday approved the sale of a 55 percent stake in paint and varnish producer Orgachim - Rousse to Bulgarian buyer Chimcolor Ltd for $9.9 million, a government statement said.</p>
<p>&quot;Bulgaria's cabinet approved the sale of a 55 percent stake in Orgachim Rousse which should be conducted by the Bulgarian Privatisation Agency,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>Orgachim had some 987.7 million levs of long-term assets at November 30, 1996. -- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-84561</p>
</text>
